# Line endings are left exactly as they are on disk.
#
# Git is configured to convert here (core.autocrlf), and it must not: an
# AutoHotkey continuation section and a CSS data: URI both care about the exact
# bytes, and this tree is a deliberate mix -- most files are LF, some are CRLF,
# and the tooling that edits them keeps each file the way it found it.
* -text
